# Pairs with TrimCoveredBySnapshot. The live advance moves the read position to
# the highest offset the leaf issued while a lower own append is still in
# flight. A capture then claims coverage over an offset the snapshot does not
# hold, the published pin licenses the trim, and the write is trimmed with no
# durable copy.
MODULE: TrimCoveredBySnapshotLiveAdvancePastUnappliedAppend
TARGET: TrimCoveredBySnapshot
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the live advance passes an own append that is not yet applied
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance

--- FIND
    /\ OwnUnapplied(l) = {}
    /\ LiveArmed(l)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: an unapplied own append does not hold the advance.
    /\ TRUE
    /\ LiveArmed(l)
--- END
